當時貴盛，鎮之為所排抑，以母老求補安成太守。及玄敗，玄將苻宏寇亂郡境，鎮之拒戰彌年，子弟五人，並臨陣見殺。母憂去職，在官清潔，妻子無以自給，乃棄家致喪還上虞舊墓。葬畢，為子標之求安復令，隨子之官。服闋，為征西道規司馬、南平太守。徐道覆逼江陵，加鎮之建威將軍，統檀道濟、到彥之等討道覆，以不經將帥，固辭，不見聽。既而前軍失利，白衣領職，尋復本官。以討道覆功，封華容縣五等男，徵廷尉。晉穆帝何皇后山陵，領將作大匠。遷御史中丞，秉正不撓，百僚憚之。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"琅邪王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"待核首次府主身份"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"謝輶","kind":"person","person_id":"ao0_c0z_ryc","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0059","start":59,"end":61,"surface":"桓玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0081","start":81,"end":83,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"王愉","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0100","start":100,"end":102,"surface":"鎮之","kind":"person","person_id":"7r6_k52_qji_ABDACAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0107","start":107,"end":108,"surface":"愉","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0109","start":109,"end":110,"surface":"綏","kind":"person","person_id":"a8f_ec8_e74_AAAAABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzhenzhi:line014:m0111","start":111,"end":112,"surface":"玄","kind":"person","person_id":"u9s_w6j_8mc_AAF","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-092-wangzh